# Build → review handoff. Transient, worktree-local. Its PRESENCE is the
# ready_for_review verdict; the review agent reads this for the change summary and the
# red-phase proof. The reviewer re-derives [REQ] coverage from the tests and re-runs
# preflight itself, so neither is restated here.
task_id: "<id>"
files_modified:
  - "<path>"
tdd_evidence:
  red_phase: |
    <the key failure lines from the Red run — proof the tests failed before the code existed>
